                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "9c51cd83-ffc4-3f36-b94d-1ee33c9a799d",
                        "entry_id": "6a176fab-72a3-346a-82e2-93ff8948eaba",
                        "glosses": [
                            "тот, кто ведёт агитацию, то есть распространяет, продвигает какие-либо идеи"
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "2d603cb6-d9a5-441f-8c8f-caa96dd4d8f2",
                                "sense_id": "9c51cd83-ffc4-3f36-b94d-1ee33c9a799d",
                                "text": "Слушайте, товарищи потомки, // агитатора, горлана-главаря."
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "26cf3063-ab7f-338d-8859-610ccac3d0bc",
                        "entry_id": "6a176fab-72a3-346a-82e2-93ff8948eaba",
                        "glosses": [
                            "жарг. подследственный или осуждённый за «агитацию» (контрреволюционную или антисоветскую)"
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": []
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "2910bd4a-992c-447c-a8e6-f1814241cbd5",
                        "source_entry_id": "6a176fab-72a3-346a-82e2-93ff8948eaba",
                        "source_sense_description": "тот, кто ведёт агитацию, то есть распространяет, продвигает какие-либо идеи",
                        "target_lang_word": "propagandist",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "propagandist",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "2c03c1c9-e671-3096-bee0-7ca4165bf386",
                                        "entry_id": "9cd2803a-24ce-31b3-96f8-4702dc1a41da",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A person who disseminates propaganda."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "4b7135ab-368c-4d3f-8ad2-85db4629a013",
                                                "sense_id": "2c03c1c9-e671-3096-bee0-7ca4165bf386",
                                                "text": "Every country has been officially invited by the Belgian Government to send delegates to the International Congress of Agricultural Associations, which will take pace at Brussels in September, 1910. In most countries propagandist committees have been formed in connection with this Congress."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "984b804a-4cb2-47a2-94ac-48778dfe45da",
                                                "sense_id": "2c03c1c9-e671-3096-bee0-7ca4165bf386",
                                                "text": "\"Astroturfers and propagandists tend to attack and controversialize the news organizations, personalities and people surrounding an issue rather than sticking to the facts.\""
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "ed4935f6-bff0-435d-91ab-aebbfe0afb44",
                                                "sense_id": "2c03c1c9-e671-3096-bee0-7ca4165bf386",
                                                "text": "It's Alexander the Great who everyone remembers and much of that is down to his and his propagandists' genius."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            },
                            {
                                "target_word": "propagandist",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "32f0387e-cc04-3a8e-aada-00ed67164087",
                                        "entry_id": "91a22915-d56a-3fd4-a696-a0f1774409b1",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Consisting of or spreading propaganda."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "c6d248fc-085f-4179-b033-5103bbc55e37",
                                                "sense_id": "32f0387e-cc04-3a8e-aada-00ed67164087",
                                                "text": "Of course many of these accounts were propagandist in intention and designed for an unsophisticated audience."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "c62681f3-fe35-44e0-9f98-ac1bda8c1ce7",
                                                "sense_id": "32f0387e-cc04-3a8e-aada-00ed67164087",
                                                "text": "In another comment from the audience, one woman raised what is perhaps the anti-pornography movement's strongest point. \"There's a strain of pornography which is incredibly propagandist against women,\" she said."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "1a39ac48-b38d-4e35-97ea-7604728fe4d8",
                        "source_entry_id": "6a176fab-72a3-346a-82e2-93ff8948eaba",
                        "source_sense_description": "тот, кто ведёт агитацию, то есть распространяет, продвигает какие-либо идеи",
                        "target_lang_word": "agitator",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "agitator",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "6884140d-d4ed-3f01-ad2b-86bd35747aa0",
                                        "entry_id": "b055ae70-6d0c-31f3-8838-689a62157864",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "One who agitates; one who stirs up or excites others, for example political reformers."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "e0ba9f0f-6ccc-4a2d-ae5f-4b3cdf322086",
                                                "sense_id": "6884140d-d4ed-3f01-ad2b-86bd35747aa0",
                                                "text": "Near-synonyms: instigator; see also Thesaurus:troublemaker"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "6b0d17cd-9939-4b4b-b83b-2ef509bdc40a",
                                                "sense_id": "6884140d-d4ed-3f01-ad2b-86bd35747aa0",
                                                "text": "In addition, they kept a watch on political agitators and foreigners arriving and departing at the port."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "26c37420-db73-49a6-a5a9-2466d58c8190",
                                                "sense_id": "6884140d-d4ed-3f01-ad2b-86bd35747aa0",
                                                "text": "I’m only aware of one anti-ICE raid incident in California over the summer in which a single agitator pointed a pistol at federal agents, and that person is apparently still at large."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "71c99ca4-42a4-358a-90ec-9eb60321ea20",
                                        "entry_id": "b055ae70-6d0c-31f3-8838-689a62157864",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "An implement for shaking or mixing."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": []
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "38d53122-57ac-3173-a1b8-4bc5663d848f",
                                        "entry_id": "b055ae70-6d0c-31f3-8838-689a62157864",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "One of a body of men appointed by the army, in Oliver Cromwell's time, to look after their interests."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "historical"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": []
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "3f10af4f-515a-4270-bf2d-35086cf2accb",
                        "source_entry_id": "6a176fab-72a3-346a-82e2-93ff8948eaba",
                        "source_sense_description": "тот, кто ведёт агитацию, то есть распространяет, продвигает какие-либо идеи",
                        "target_lang_word": "Agitator",
                        "target_lang_code": "de",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "Agitator",
                                "target_lang_code": "de",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "9e796fca-3df0-3fd2-9647-1b19406a6712",
                                        "entry_id": "a448202b-2e06-3a68-9e5d-68459b519937",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "jemand, der durch anspornende oder aufhetzende Reden oder Schriften, Menschenmassen zu bestimmten gemeinsamen Handlungen bewegen möchte; Person, die Agitation betreibt"
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "derogatory",
                                            "usually"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "83f20bc3-26cb-487f-a057-b570c0c03c33",
                                                "sense_id": "9e796fca-3df0-3fd2-9647-1b19406a6712",
                                                "text": "„François Noël Babeuf, genannt Gracchus Babeuf […] war Journalist und ein linksrevolutionärer französischer Agitator während der ersten französischen Revolution.“"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "ee7a7348-c34c-4191-9dde-06b5fac1e466",
                                                "sense_id": "9e796fca-3df0-3fd2-9647-1b19406a6712",
                                                "text": "„Anders als seine Mitstreiter sieht er [Gábor Vona] harmlos aus: blauer Strickpullover, darunter ein gestreiftes Businesshemd, die braunen Augen blicken sanft. Dabei ist der 30-Jährige der gefährlichste Agitator im Magyarenland.“"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "2b761eab-91f4-4341-be39-e5b05488dafa",
                                                "sense_id": "9e796fca-3df0-3fd2-9647-1b19406a6712",
                                                "text": "„Kaum verschlüsselt schildert der Autor den Auftritt eines charismatischen politischen Agitators, dem bald die Massen zuströmen sollten.“"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "9fc8d94d-438e-4fcb-befe-204144c73a58",
                                                "sense_id": "9e796fca-3df0-3fd2-9647-1b19406a6712",
                                                "text": "„Für das Empfinden bürgerlicher Ästheten hatte der Dichter zugunsten des Agitators abgedankt.“"
                                            }
                                        ],
                                        "sense_index_json": "\"1\""
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "cbaa6cff-a993-43b3-b855-81ae77eb61ae",
                        "source_entry_id": "6a176fab-72a3-346a-82e2-93ff8948eaba",
                        "source_sense_description": "тот, кто ведёт агитацию, то есть распространяет, продвигает какие-либо идеи",
                        "target_lang_word": "propagandiste",
                        "target_lang_code": "fr",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "propagandiste",
                                "target_lang_code": "fr",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "a77e92a1-3241-3743-a854-2594ca9f144c",
                                        "entry_id": "cb87ec21-df06-3830-b6b3-e7e174c0dfa1",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Celui, celle qui fait de la propagande pour une idée."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "b4c2a22b-6dd7-4283-bcdb-cb98b69dfb14",
                                                "sense_id": "a77e92a1-3241-3743-a854-2594ca9f144c",
                                                "text": "Le parti socialiste allemand tira une force particulière de l'idée catastrophique que ses propagandistes répandaient partout et qui fut prise très au sérieux tant que les persécutions bismarckiennes maintinrent un esprit belliqueux dans les groupes."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "f94785d1-cda4-4f18-b1df-fe688cf04c1d",
                                                "sense_id": "a77e92a1-3241-3743-a854-2594ca9f144c",
                                                "text": "Je suis un vieux propagandiste et je sais que, lorsqu'on a constitué dans tel chef-lieu de canton, telle section, avec une douzaine de camarades paysans vigoureux et résolus, on n'a pas transformé le canton lui-même."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "15b030d3-aa48-4fa0-923e-e2ef787cd05a",
                                                "sense_id": "a77e92a1-3241-3743-a854-2594ca9f144c",
                                                "text": "Comment un sous-préfet, si inspiré par Vichy, serait-il parvenu, une fois à l'échelon supérieur, l'ardent propagandiste du retour au régime républicain qui se profile dans les combats de la Libération ?"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "283674e4-29ff-4253-ab45-c0f65b9e1b40",
                                                "sense_id": "a77e92a1-3241-3743-a854-2594ca9f144c",
                                                "text": "Nombreux, organisés, ardents propagandistes, les anarchistes saint-juniauds semblent d'évidence peser d'un poids conséquent sur la vie socio-politique, voire économique de la cité gantière."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
